### Food Delivery Platform - clickable requests
### Needs the VS Code extension "REST Client" (humao.rest-client).
### Click "Send Request" above each one. Run top to bottom; start the stack first.
### (The browser UI at http://localhost:8080 does all of this with buttons.)

@customers = http://localhost:8081/api/v1
@restaurants = http://localhost:8082/api/v1
@orders = http://localhost:8083/api/v1
@payments = http://localhost:8084/api/v1
@delivery = http://localhost:8085/api/v1
@notifications = http://localhost:8086/api/v1
@admin = http://localhost:8087/api/v1

### 0. Browse: customers, restaurants (with openNow), a menu
GET {{customers}}/customers
###
GET {{restaurants}}/restaurants
###
GET {{restaurants}}/restaurants/rest-001/menu

### 1. CUSTOMER places an order
# @name newOrder
POST {{orders}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "cust-001",
  "restaurantId": "rest-001",
  "items": [
    { "itemId": "item-001", "name": "Kapana (6 pieces)", "quantity": 2, "unitPrice": 45.00 },
    { "itemId": "item-002", "name": "Fat cakes", "quantity": 3, "unitPrice": 15.00 }
  ],
  "deliveryAddress": { "street": "12 Robert Mugabe Ave", "city": "Windhoek", "latitude": -22.57, "longitude": 17.0836 }
}

@orderId = {{newOrder.response.body.orderId}}

### 2. Wait ~2 s: payment-service has charged it -> CONFIRMED
GET {{orders}}/orders/{{orderId}}
###
GET {{payments}}/payments?orderId={{orderId}}

### 3. delivery-service has assigned the nearest driver
# @name delivery
GET {{delivery}}/deliveries/order/{{orderId}}

@deliveryId = {{delivery.response.body.deliveryId}}

### 4a. RESTAURANT starts cooking
PATCH {{orders}}/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "PREPARING" }

### 4b. RESTAURANT marks it ready
PATCH {{orders}}/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "READY" }

### 5a. DRIVER picks up -> OUT_FOR_DELIVERY
POST {{delivery}}/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}/pickup

### 5b. DRIVER delivers -> DELIVERED
POST {{delivery}}/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}/complete

### 6. Audit trail, notifications, customer history
GET {{orders}}/orders/{{orderId}}/history
###
GET {{notifications}}/notifications/order/{{orderId}}
###
GET {{customers}}/customers/cust-001/orders

### 7. Reports
GET {{admin}}/reports/summary
###
GET {{admin}}/reports/restaurants
###
GET {{admin}}/reports/delivery-performance

### 8. Guard rails: cancel after delivery -> 409; event-only status -> 400
POST {{orders}}/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel
###
PATCH {{orders}}/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "DELIVERED" }

### 9. Failure path: over the NAD 2000 card limit -> declined -> CANCELLED
# @name bigOrder
POST {{orders}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "cust-002", "restaurantId": "rest-001",
  "items": [{ "itemId": "item-003", "name": "Oshifima & stew", "quantity": 35, "unitPrice": 65.00 }],
  "deliveryAddress": { "street": "13 Jackson Kaujeua St", "city": "Windhoek" }
}

### (send ~2 s later)
GET {{orders}}/orders/{{bigOrder.response.body.orderId}}/history

### 10. Cancel a paid order -> payment REFUNDED, stock returned, driver freed
# @name toCancel
POST {{orders}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "cust-002", "restaurantId": "rest-001",
  "items": [{ "itemId": "item-002", "name": "Fat cakes", "quantity": 2, "unitPrice": 15.00 }],
  "deliveryAddress": { "street": "13 Jackson Kaujeua St", "city": "Windhoek" }
}

### (send ~2 s later, once CONFIRMED)
POST {{orders}}/orders/{{toCancel.response.body.orderId}}/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "changed my mind" }

###
GET {{payments}}/payments?orderId={{toCancel.response.body.orderId}}

### 11. Drivers: list, go online/offline, move
GET {{delivery}}/drivers
###
PATCH {{delivery}}/drivers/drv-003/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "AVAILABLE" }
###
PUT {{delivery}}/drivers/drv-003/location
Content-Type: application/json

{ "latitude": -22.556, "longitude": 17.072 }
